      "part": "Data structures and sorting",
      "title": "Algorithms and Computation",
      "summary": "What a computational problem and an algorithm are, how to argue correctness by induction (birthday matching) and efficiency with asymptotic notation, and the word-RAM model of computation that all later running times assume.",
